          "end": 36.96,
          "en": "to the recipe detail component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 36.96,
          "end": 40.29,
          "en": "So, does cross component communication.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 40.29,
          "end": 42.09,
          "en": "That is a super long way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 42.09,
          "end": 45.3,
          "en": "for just informing another component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 45.3,
          "end": 47.31,
