          "end": 74.85,
          "en": "of output and event matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 74.85,
          "end": 78.84,
          "en": "Instead here I want to call some method in my service,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 78.84,
          "end": 82.833,
          "en": "which will then will transfer this data for me.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 83.78999999999999,
          "end": 87.75,
          "en": "So, in the recipe service, I'll add a new property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 87.75,
          "end": 90.51,
          "en": "a public property, which will name recipe selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 90.51,
          "end": 93.18,
          "en": "Of course, you could choose a different name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 93.18,
          "end": 95.88,
          "en": "It will be an object instantiated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 95.88,
          "end": 98.94,
          "en": "by using event emitter from angular core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 98.94,
          "end": 100.95,
          "en": "So, you need to add this import.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 100.95,
          "end": 102.96000000000001,
          "en": "Let's put it at a top of the file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 102.96000000000001,
          "end": 104.31,
          "en": "That's kind of a good practice to do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 104.31,
          "end": 106.68,
          "en": "with your angular imports.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 106.68,
          "end": 109.56,
          "en": "It will hold some recipe data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 109.56,
          "end": 112.95,
          "en": "And that's all I want to do in the recipe service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 112.95,
          "end": 114.27000000000001,
          "en": "With this setup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 114.27000000000001,
          "end": 116.1,
          "en": "and, of course, you could also encapsulate this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 116.1,
          "end": 117.84,
          "en": "by providing a method to get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
