          "end": 119.28,
          "en": "to it in one to emit the event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 119.28,
          "end": 122.79,
          "en": "But, I will use the property itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 122.79,
          "end": 123.9,
          "en": "So by adding this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 123.9,
          "end": 127.23,
          "en": "I can now go back to my recipe item component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 127.23,
          "end": 130.32,
          "en": "And an on selected, I want to do something,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 130.32,
          "end": 132.81,
          "en": "with that property in the recipe service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 132.81,
          "end": 134.85,
          "en": "So, first of all, let's uncheck that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 134.85,
          "end": 136.56,
          "en": "Let's uncheck the recipe service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 136.56,
          "end": 139.56,
          "en": "As you learn to do it, make sure to import it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 139.56,
          "end": 142.563,
          "en": "pointing to the recipe service file in the right folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 143.43,
          "end": 145.23,
          "en": "And then on the recipe service,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 145.23,
          "end": 148.89,
          "en": "we can use this recipe selected event emitter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 148.89,
          "end": 152.31,
          "en": "and call emit, and emit the recipe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
