        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 182.79,
          "end": 186.18,
          "en": "And in your recipes component HTML file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 186.18,
          "end": 188.13,
          "en": "we can also get rid of this event here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 188.13,
          "end": 191.52,
          "en": "on the recipe list, because we no longer use this chain",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 191.52,
          "end": 194.1,
          "en": "of data to pass it around.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 194.1,
          "end": 196.98,
          "en": "And now all I want to do is in this component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 196.98,
          "end": 201.15,
          "en": "I want to listen to this event in the recipe service,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 201.15,
          "end": 203.76,
          "en": "so that I can now correctly decide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 203.76,
          "end": 205.44,
          "en": "whether we do have a selected recipe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 205.44,
          "end": 207.96,
          "en": "and should therefore render the detail component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 207.96,
          "end": 210.24,
          "en": "Or, if we should still show this template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 210.24,
          "end": 213.27,
          "en": "with display, please select a recipe text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 213.27,
          "end": 217.05,
          "en": "Therefore, I will inject the service here too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 217.05,
          "end": 218.19,
          "en": "Recipe service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 218.19,
          "end": 221.76,
          "en": "And since I provide the recipe service on this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 221.76,
          "end": 224.01,
          "en": "this component, and all the other components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 224.01,
          "end": 227.52,
          "en": "in this recipe folder use the same instance of the service,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 227.52,
          "end": 229.41,
          "en": "which, of course, is super important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 229.41,
          "end": 232.38,
          "en": "Otherwise, the service where I emit the event,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 232.38,
          "end": 235.07999999999998,
          "en": "would be a different one to the one I listen to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 235.07999999999998,
          "end": 237.9,
          "en": "So, I would never get informed about the event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 237.9,
          "end": 241.59,
          "en": "But here it will work because we're using the same instance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 241.59,
          "end": 244.5,
          "en": "So here in \"NgOnInit()\", for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 244.5,
          "end": 247.44,
          "en": "I can set up my listener.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 247.44,
          "end": 249.54,
          "en": "So, on the recipe selected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 249.54,
          "end": 254.013,
          "en": "I can subscribe to it, and get informed about any changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 254.97,
          "end": 258.03,
          "en": "And now here, I know I will receive some data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 258.03,
          "end": 259.83,
          "en": "which is of type recipe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 259.83,
          "end": 262.17,
          "en": "because that's how we configure the event emitter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 262.17,
          "end": 263.913,
          "en": "It will give us a recipe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 265.02,
          "end": 267.81,
          "en": "And in this ES six arrow function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 267.81,
          "end": 269.19,
          "en": "that is the argument list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 269.19,
          "end": 271.68,
          "en": "and here is the function body.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 271.68,
          "end": 276.27,
          "en": "Here, I simply want to set this select recipe equal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 276.27,
          "end": 278.553,
          "en": "to the recipe we got with the event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 279.48,
          "end": 283.47,
          "en": "And with that, we should get the same behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 283.47,
          "end": 286.74,
          "en": "as before if we reload the app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 286.74,
          "end": 290.67,
          "en": "But now having a much leaner approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 290.67,
          "end": 294.72,
          "en": "of using a service for cross component communication,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 294.72,
          "end": 296.4,
          "en": "which of course, makes it much easier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 296.4,
          "end": 298.86,
          "en": "to pass this data as you saw.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 298.86,
          "end": 302.34,
          "en": "And, we don't have to build this complex chain,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 302.34,
          "end": 304.983,
          "en": "of event and property binding.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
